  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5602.01 Where to Obtain Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5602.01 Where to Obtain Information.\n\n(a) Motor vehicle records are maintained at the Department of Safety, Division of Motor Vehicles, 23 Hazen Drive, Concord, NH.\n\n(b) Mail requests shall be sent to Department of Safety, Division of Motor Vehicles, 23 Hazen Drive, ATTN: Records, Concord, NH, 03305.\n\n(c) Requests may be made in person at any Division of Motor Vehicles location.\n\nSource. #6403, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-97; rpld and ss by #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02; ss by #13152 EXEMPT, eff 12-31-20",
